 "source_instruction": "i need a toasted brown wig that is made from natural hair.",
 "query": "I\u2019ve been spending my evenings this week helping my neighbor fix up the overgrown raised garden beds in her front yard, right? She\u2019s in her late 70s and had knee surgery back in April, so she hasn\u2019t been able to bend down to pull weeds or thin out the wild strawberry vines that have completely taken over half the beds since last summer. Yesterday we found three tiny baby bunnies tucked in a nest under a clump of overgrown mint, all fuzzy with their eyes still barely open, and we had to pause for 20 minutes just to make sure we didn\u2019t accidentally disturb their little spot while we worked. She even sent me home with a giant bundle of fresh mint and a jar of her homemade rhubarb jam after we finished up for the night, which made all the dirt under my nails and the tiny thorn pricks on my wrists totally worth it.\nHey there, I\u2019m looking for a wig or hair extension made of yak belly hair, right? I definitely want it in the toasted brown shade, and it\u2019d be great if it comes with a free satin storage pouch to keep it in when I\u2019m not wearing it. I\u2019m trying not to spend too much on this, so can you show me options that fit what I\u2019m after? Oh, I had a bad experience with a scratchy wig last month that left my scalp itchy for days, so I really want to make sure this one works out.",
